IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Telecommunications Act 1999: WHICH PRINTED TEXT OF THE ACT GOVERNS A DAY, on two time axes.
--
-- DESIGN (assumed, not ruled: team lead's instruction of 2026-11-04).  Each version of the Act's text is a row with
--   an EFFECTIVE day  (valid time: the first day the text governs conduct), and
--   a PUBLISHED day   (rule-version time: the first day a reader could have read it in the Gazette, with its date of effect).
-- A question carries the CONDUCT day and the READING day ("the day the law is read as at").  The answer is the version with the latest
-- published day among those published on or before the reading day whose effective day is on or before the conduct day; with none, NOTHING.
-- Stable l4 1.6.98 removed the language's own built-ins for this (RULES EFFECTIVE DATE, EVAL UNDER VALID TIME, EVAL AS OF SYSTEM TIME);
-- the two days are therefore ordinary DATE inputs and the versions are a table.  On `unstable` the table would use the built-ins.
--
-- THE ROWS, and what each rests on (deposited texts in registers/source-bundle/, all from the e-Gazette except the last):
--   Revised Edition 2000          effective 30 Dec 2000, published 30 Dec 2000.  The edition's own date; the PDF does not show a Gazette publication day.
--   as amended by Act 10 of 2005  effective 16 Feb 2005, published 16 Feb 2005 (Act first published 5:00 pm that day).  The commencement notification,
--                                 S 76/2005 (TA1999.S76-2005.txt, deposited 2026-11-04 from the e-Gazette, first published 16 Feb 2005 5:00 pm), brings the
--                                 whole Act into operation on 16 Feb 2005 except sections 10 and 11 (paragraph 2 of S 76/2005); that agrees with the Legislative History
--                                 entry (TA1999.txt:7134-7143).  Section 10 repeals s 19 and section 11 amends s 20(5) (TA1999.ACT10-2005:267-271);
--                                 their own commencement day is not in a deposited text.
--   as amended by Act 19 of 2011  effective 1 Feb 2012, published 31 Jan 2012.  The Act was first published on 20 Jan 2012 without a date of effect;
--                                 S 33/2012, first published 31 Jan 2012, fixed 1 February 2012.  The version is "published" for this purpose when its
--                                 date of effect became public, so 31 Jan 2012.
--   as amended by Act 22 of 2016  effective 1 Oct 2016, published 29 Sep 2016.  Act 22 of 2016 is the Info-communications Media Development Authority Act 2016; its section 100
--                                 amends the Telecommunications Act (TA1999.ACT22-2016.txt, Acts Supplement No. 19 of 2016, first published 29 Sep 2016 5:00 pm).  Its commencement
--                                 notification S 461/2016 (TA1999.S461-2016.txt, first published 29 Sep 2016 5.00 pm) brings the Act into operation on 1 Oct 2016 except sections 89,
--                                 90(1) and 96(v), which come into operation on 2 Oct 2016; section 100 is in the first group.
--   as amended by Act 30 of 2016  effective 1 Feb 2017, published 13 Jan 2017.  Act 30 of 2016 is the Telecommunications (Amendment) Act 2016 (TA1999.ACT30-2016.txt, Acts Supplement
--                                 No. 2 of 2017, first published 9 Jan 2017 5 pm, "No. 30 of 2016" on its face; the supplement's own date line reads "FRIDAY, JANUARY 13", four
--                                 days after the publication line).  It "comes into operation on a date that the Minister appoints" (section 1); S 14/2017 (TA1999.S14-2017.txt,
--                                 first published 13 Jan 2017 5 pm) appoints 1 Feb 2017.  The version is "published" for this purpose when its date of effect became public, so
--                                 13 Jan 2017, as for Act 19 of 2011.
--   as amended by Act 15 of 2017  effective 23 May 2017, published ASSUMED 23 May 2017.  Act 15 of 2017 is the Companies (Amendment) Act 2017 (TA1999.ACT15-2017.txt, Acts Supplement No. 17 of 2017,
--                                 first published 30 Mar 2017 5 pm, "No. 15 of 2017" on its face, deposited 2026-11-04 from the e-Gazette).  It "comes into operation on a date that the Minister
--                                 appoints by notification in the Gazette" (section 1); the commencement notification is NOT deposited, so the day, 23 May 2017, is the Legislative History's
--                                 (TA1999.txt:7181-7190, "Commencement : 23 May 2017 (section 53(6))") and the published day is assumed to be the same.  Its only amendment of this Act is section 53(6),
--                                 which inserts "or 211I" after "section 210" in sections 32J(3)(a) and 32L(1)(b) and (2)(a); a search of the whole 114-page Act for "Telecommunications Act" finds
--                                 no other hit.  It touches none of ss 2 "equipment", 33 to 36, 65, 72 and 73 (now ss 2, 53 to 56, 85, 95 and 96), so every flag below for this version equals Act 30 of 2016's, on the Act's printed text.
--   as amended by Acts after Act 15 of 2017 that are not deposited
--                                 effective 16 May 2018 (Act 26 of 2018, section 61, the next Act on the Legislative History, TA1999.txt:7192-7205), published ASSUMED 16 May 2018.
--                                 The constructor name is the name this row had when no text of any Act after Act 15 of 2017 was deposited.  Eight of those Acts and one Order are now deposited as enacted (2026-11-04: Acts 26 and 40 of 2018, 15 of 2019, 12 of 2020, 4 and 25 of 2021, 31 of 2022 and 13 of 2026, and G.N. No. S 26/2022; sgta-i-acts-after-2017.l4),
--                                 and none amends a word that a flag below reports.  The row is NOT split into one row per Act here, because that would make the seat's "on the texts deposited" tier answer
--                                 from 16 May 2018 where it now answers NOTHING (NOTES.md finding 36); so no answer rests on this row except through the Act's own amendment markers.  This one row stands for every later Act on the history (16 May 2018 to 1 Nov 2022 and 1 Oct 2025), as the row before the consolidation always did.
--   the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO
--                                 effective 2 Oct 2026, published ASSUMED 2 Oct 2026 (the consolidation says "version in force from 2/10/2026"; its
--                                 retrieval day was 9 Oct 2026).
-- The Legislative History (TA1999.txt:7121-7240) lists no other Act amending the Act between the 2000 Revised Edition and Act 22 of 2016, nor between Act 30 of 2016 and Act 15 of 2017, nor between Act 15 of 2017 and Act 26 of 2018.

DECLARE `Act text version` IS ONE OF
    `Revised Edition 2000`
    `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
    `as amended by Act 19 of 2011`
    `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`
    `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`
    `as amended by Act 15 of 2017`
    `as amended by Acts after Act 15 of 2017 that are not deposited`
    `the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO`

