-- src:TA1999.20001230:2032 | casting Authority Act (Cap. 297) except in respect of the regulation
-- src:TA1999.20001230:2033 | of any telecommunication system required for the operation of any
-- src:TA1999.20001230:2034 | broadcasting service or the approval of any broadcasting apparatus
-- src:TA1999.20001230:2035 | used in accordance with section 9.
