-- src:TA1999.ACT10-2005:1190 | substituting the words “Broadcasting Act (Cap. 28)”.
@ref s 72 of the 2000 Edition (src:TA1999.20001230:2030-2035); Act 10 of 2005 section 2(a) (src:TA1999.ACT10-2005:42-47); Act 10 of 2005 section 30 (src:TA1999.ACT10-2005:1188-1190)
GIVEN v IS AN `Act text version`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`TA versions: the carve-out for broadcasting apparatus names the Singapore Broadcasting Authority Act (Cap. 297)` MEANS
    CONSIDER v
    WHEN `Revised Edition 2000` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `as amended by Act 10 of 2005` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `as amended by Act 19 of 2011` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `as amended by Act 22 of 2016` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `as amended by Act 30 of 2016` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `as amended by Act 15 of 2017` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `as amended by Acts after Act 15 of 2017 that are not deposited` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO` THEN FALSE

-- s 33(1) of the 2000 Edition (s 53(1) today), the prohibition on running a telecommunication system or service without a licence: Act 30 of 2016 section 18 inserted, after
-- "licence granted under section 5", the words ", or during the suspension of the person's licence under section 8" (section 8 of the 2000 Edition is section 10 today).
-- The row for the Acts after Act 15 of 2017 is an INFERENCE from the consolidation (the eight Acts and one Order that amend this Act are deposited, sgta-i-acts-after-2017.l4, and none touches s 33(1)): the 2026 consolidation prints the words with the marker [30/2016] and no later marker on the subsection.
